NOTE ON THE STATUTORY TEXT

The text of the Digital Personal Data Protection Act, 2023 (Act 22 of 2023) and
the Digital Personal Data Protection Rules, 2025 are works of the Government of
India. Their reproduction here is permitted under section 52(1)(q) of the
Copyright Act, 1957, which excepts the reproduction of any Act of a Legislature
from copyright infringement. The MIT licence above applies to this repository's
commentary, tooling and skill definition, not to the statutory text itself.
